This is emotionally intelligent work that prioritizes dignity and safety, but it's somewhat idealized and over-intellectualized for practical mediation. The respondent would benefit from grounding their approach in more concrete, conversational language and from being more willing to challenge parties toward resolution rather than simply validating their positions.

